# SEO

- Every indexable page needs unique title + description via centralized SEO helpers.
- Emit JSON-LD with builders in `@/lib/seo/structured-data` (Organization, WebSite, SoftwareApplication, Article, BreadcrumbList, FAQPage).
- Canonical URLs must use `siteConfig.url` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`.
- Landing pages are content-configured in `src/content/landing/pages.ts`.
- Mark sample/illustrative content clearly (`isSample`, `isIllustrative`) — never present placeholders as real customers.
- Prefer crawlable HTML; do not hide primary copy behind client-only rendering.
